Comment: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:21.76,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:28.72,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.16,0:01:32.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Ryu, standby okay!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:34.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, standby for docking.\NReady?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:40.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going in, Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,5... 4...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,3... 2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:47.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laser searcher synchronized.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,5... 4...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam B Parts released!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Core Change! Docking, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.90,0:02:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After deserting the White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.31,0:02:11.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Amuro may never train like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:20.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The battleship Gwazine\Nhad departed from Granada...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...a Zeon frontline base on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It belonged to Rear Admiral Kycilia Zabi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:28.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...eldest daughter of the Zabi family...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:30.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and commander of Zeon's\NMobile Assault Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:37.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kycilia was visiting M'Quve,\Nwho supervised the mining of resources...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.67,0:02:42.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...which were considered vital\Nto both the Federation and Zeon forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The war effort had continued\Nregardless of the White Base's troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:38.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do\Nif Amuro comes back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.29,0:04:41.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well you know,\Na deserter would certainly be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! You must be lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:48.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what military regulations dictate, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you think of doing that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...to someone who's fought at your side?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It just means we can do it if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that, Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:05:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Fraw Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:02.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I understand why Amuro left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why should I ask him to come back to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:07.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, Fraw Bow. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:11.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not regular military here,\Nso we'd never do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:12.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, Ryu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:16.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we can't continue to overlook\NAmuro's selfish behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's true that he's\Nbehaving pretty badly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:23.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Fraw Bow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:37.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Hey, take me along too!\N- I want to go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:40.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you can't come. This isn't a joy ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:43.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to look for Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think she can convince him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:53.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all a question of timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:58.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think that big brother Amuro\Nis a V.S.O.P?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:59.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,V.S.O.P?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Don't you know?\NIt means, 'very important person'.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:04.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Maybe I got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let them do anything foolish to Amuro.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:19.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll take responsibility.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll guarantee it, too.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'll go and find him, won't you?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:26.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry! I shouldn't have barged in like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't this thing\Nwhat everyone's worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:48.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll forgive you if you go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:53.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive me? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai says deserters\Nare punishable by death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:00.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, that's how everyone really feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:03.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:07.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone aboard the White Base\Nneeds your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:08.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Running away again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth is that you're not confident\Nthat everyone will accept you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you can't go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly understand how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:30.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:46.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long do we have to sit here doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't go anywhere\Nuntil Fraw Bow's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:53.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we get moving again,\Nwe can just tell her where we went.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:56.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, they say Central Asia\Nis neutral territory...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:58.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but there're a lot of Zeon troops around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if they intercept our radio?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:05.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When Amuro gets back, I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:15.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a metallic response at 2 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking,\Nstopping so suddenly?! It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She should just go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We get two grams in a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a good quality Solium deposit,\Njust as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:50.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we can find five more deposits like this,\Nour forces will be able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:52.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not only about Solium.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation must not get even\None gram of any precious resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what will lead us\Nto a decisive victory...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and will also establish our control\Nafter the war is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:12.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's another similar deposit{\i}\N{\i1}50 kilometers to the north.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll make sure you have all the men{\i}\N{\i1}and equipment you need.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew this was the Zeon mine!\NI finally found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:21.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's going on up there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why won't you tell me anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:25.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't shout like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a Zeon mining base there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:29.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! What if they see you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:36.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How rude! I'm not that careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:42.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow! That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:44.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've gotta tell the White Base about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! If the enemy hears our transmission,\Nwe'll be at a disadvantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw, you go back to the White Base\Nand tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:56.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- What about you, Amuro?\N- I'll stay here and continue observing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:57.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.34,0:11:04.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,3 hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:06.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marker, any message?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:08.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.35,0:11:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:12.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the enemy found us here,\Nwe'd make an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.35,0:11:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We know. Don't take your eyes off\Nthe sonar searcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:20.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any chance he's defected to Zeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:21.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:23.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'd treat him like a hero\Nif he brings them the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:27.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is a deserter, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:28.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:38.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This must be the Zeon mine...\NGeneral Revil plans to take on Odessa Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:41.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't have a single Zaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:43.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:59.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I take this place out with Gundam,\Nthe Federation forces won't have to mobilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright and Ms. Mirai\Nwon't mess around with me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lady Kycilia, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:33.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to tell them, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I'm spotted, I'll have to deal with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare Adzam for launch at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M'Quve, I'm not sure if I can forgive you\Nfor failing to detect that mobile suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My apologies, Lady Kycilia...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.83,0:12:57.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a good opportunity to test the Adzam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.55,0:12:59.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lady Kycilia. I certainly will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:05.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seeing the Federation's mobile suit\Nup close and in person...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:07.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...will be useful for our future strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.39,0:13:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Behind me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it over...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Its performance seems far superior\Nto what Garma's data suggested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M'Quve, approach it carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:13.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:43.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's above me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have the higher ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launch the Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surface temperature, 4,000 degrees?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it because of that sand-like stuff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:35.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Releasing 98% of all energy...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:39.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...for pilot and circuit protection.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.82,0:16:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,98%?!\NI won't be able to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:46.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A base near something that looks\Nlike a mine? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:49.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:50.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't quite match the location...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...in the Federation estimates\Nwhich General Revil told us about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not making this up! I saw it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.57,0:16:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:17:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case, we can't just ignore it.\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:06.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's working, Lady Kycilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, we do have more experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...in mobile suit research.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The magnetic radiation field is weakening.\NFinish him off quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:15.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Offensive energy reduced.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:20.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can move, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:27.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He deflected it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:29.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Zaku would have been crippled by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:36.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.78,0:17:39.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Shake him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:07.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not going to dump me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:27.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Destroy the base before our secrets get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:31.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... But there are still soldiers there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:32.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our state secrets are the priority now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:36.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The base... exploded...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They abandoned... the base...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:08.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation mobile suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Its performance is greater than rumored.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:13.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will have to speed up\Nthe deployment...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:16.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...of all the mobile suits we're testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:25.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation was gonna hit this Zeon base\Nwith all of its force, and I destroyed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This one isn't any good, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:49.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All data systems have been\Ncompletely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:19:57.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:02.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"102nd Mining Base..."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the 102nd Mining Base?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.27,0:20:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that mean what I destroyed\Nwas just one...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...of many mining bases?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:16.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this isn't the mine that General Revil\Nis trying to take down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:20.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it a mine even bigger than this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:53.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:56.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just someone passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.95,0:21:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There should be a Federation or Zeon\Nrescue crew soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.91,0:21:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:11.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The bleeding's stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:13.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please use it if you see help arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:20.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks. Think they'll come so soon?\NA rescue...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:22.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:25.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mustn't lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.65,0:21:30.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.11,0:21:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you said you were\Nthe pilot of that mobile suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I'd find it hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you are, don't go soft on your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have enough lives for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:47.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not enough lives, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A flare!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:05.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's confirm. Approach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow...\NAre you sure this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.44,0:22:14.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did the Gundam do all this on its own?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.53,0:22:17.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't think of any other possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... this wasn't their main base.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:27.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it was, it wouldn't have fallen\Nwith the Gundam alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's caused quite a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:32.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to say that,\Nbecause of the Gundam...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.66,0:22:35.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the enemy will be on guard\Nand digging their heels in hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro must think he's a hero\Nright about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.12,0:22:40.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I can't see him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.24,0:22:43.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.02,0:22:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's his problem...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.97,0:22:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who does Amuro think he is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.07,0:22:59.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He has no idea how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.79,0:23:21.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro sees his foes up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:25.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ral's troops are planning\Nan attack on the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.26,0:23:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When the Gundam's beam rifle\Nhits the Gouf...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:32.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the enemy laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.43,0:23:36.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NRamba Ral's Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.14,0:23:39.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
